<title>USA: CFI Mortgage Inc makes strong debut.</title>
<headline>CFI Mortgage Inc makes strong debut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>CFI Mortgage Inc rose sharply on Tuesday, closing at eight only hours after an initial offering of one million shares priced at $5 a share.</p>
<p>As a planned initial public offering, CFI had proposed a total one million shares at a target price of $5 under the trading symbol on the Nasdaq National Market.</p>
</text>
